# Screenshots Directory

Place your application screenshots here:

- `dashboard_screen.png`: Overview Dashboard with AQI Gauge, Temperature, Weather Details
- `map_layers_screen.png`: 4-Layer GIS Environmental Map view
- `location_picker_screen.png`: Dropped custom pin with nearest province resolution
- `thermal_hotspots_screen.png`: NASA FIRMS satellite thermal radiance map
- `advisor_screen.png`: Health & Outdoor Activity modal sheet
